# eval/runs/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The scored runs are the evidence for every
# claim this project makes about retrieval quality, the Evaluation screen reads them
# straight off disk, and they are a few KB of JSON each. Ignoring them meant a fresh
# clone showed an empty Evaluation page and the measurement history lived on one laptop.

